{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Considerable Grandfather is on the hunt for Creek, his dearest dog &amp; best friend, who went missing during an overnight break-in by the Molemen, a collective of organized humanoid moles, scavenging for equipment to contribute to their unknown device.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Rescue Boggies!</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal of most stages in a given location is to rescue all of the stray Boggies. Bring them to the Boggie Door to save them &amp; get them on the path back to their homes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/cg-storegif-rescueboggies2.gif?t=1748459425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Dig Holes!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your trusty iron shovel to dig holes in the dirt to trap enemies, take shortcuts, or reach inaccessible areas! You can't dig through rock though!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/cg-storegif-digholes.gif?t=1748459425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Survive.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now that the Boggies are safe, you must save yourself next. Be careful out there on your way to the Exit Door! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/extras/cg-storegif-survive.gif?t=1748459425\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Best Friends Don't Let Each Other Down.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put retirement aside. Your good boy needs you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2450290?t=1748459425","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748459